{"product_id":"once-we-were-hybrid-chronicles-2","title":"Once We Were (Hybrid Chronicles, 2)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn the second novel in the Hybrid Chronicles—perfect for fans of Ally Condie, Lauren Oliver, and Scott Westerfeld—Eva and Addie struggle to share their body as they clash over romance and the fight for hybrid freedom.Addie and Eva escaped imprisonment at a horrific psychiatric hospital. Now they should be safe, living among an underground hybrid movement. But safety is starting to feel constricting. Faced with the possibility of being in hiding forever, the girls are eager to help bring about change—now. The answer seems to lie in a splinter group willing to go to extremes for hybrid freedom, but as Addie and Eva fall ever deeper into their plans, what they thought was the solution to their problems might just be the thing that destroys everything—including their bond to each other.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 201 x 25\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Zhang Kat\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780062114914\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 342\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45487642968217,"sku":"11RE9780062114914","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6859262e26812_Once_We_Were__Hybrid_Chronicles__2__Zhang_Kat.jpg?v=1750689068","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/once-we-were-hybrid-chronicles-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}